    "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is finally here!!<br>Now you can take the time to get involved with the world of CPA: Reports Bousy and its story.<br><br>The CPA initial report shows the first-person perspective of a vlogger exploring an abandoned house. During this exploration, the vlogger realized that this house was actually hiding a paranormal entity related to the tragic past of the owners' house.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the horror directly from a first-person perspective and enroll an adventure between you and a strong friendship with a tragic story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Replayability Mode: Interact more with Bousy, uncover a hidden side story involving the CPA, and experience unique new mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A video report from the CPA (Central Paranormal Agency) shows an unknown person's perspective on a journey through the crowded and old walls of an abandoned house, hiding a dramatic and obscure story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world where nightmares in real life are possible, and where the logics of steampunk/retro eras run the environment, players will embody the perspective of someone who will have to run, hide, and use different mechanics to survive the constant dread and danger of a creature, that emerges from anger and sadness, while trying to complete the main achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of mechanics to guide you through mysterious hiding places and sense what lies beyond human sight. Avoid the various dangers lurking in the darkness in order to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the horror directly from a first-person perspective and enroll an adventure between you and a strong friendship with a tragic story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arcade Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Replayability Mode: Interact more with Bousy, uncover a hidden side story involving the CPA, and experience unique new mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A video report from the CPA (Central Paranormal Agency) shows an unknown person's perspective on a journey through the crowded and old walls of an abandoned house, hiding a dramatic and obscure story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/bbf40d6f330c97f295dcc597af1bf4c9.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a world where nightmares in real life are possible, and where the logics of steampunk/retro eras run the environment, players will embody the perspective of someone who will have to run, hide, and use different mechanics to survive the constant dread and danger of a creature, that emerges from anger and sadness, while trying to complete the main achievement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/9737944cb90922f4772590522d474717.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of mechanics to guide you through mysterious hiding places and sense what lies beyond human sight. Avoid the various dangers lurking in the darkness in order to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.poster.avif?t=1740680095\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.webm?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974100/extras/26ee7e28d62b7f7e1432e609bf672214.mp4?t=1740680095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
